{"2810550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAGER", "steam_appid": 2810550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAGER</strong> is a 1-bit 3D Kafkaesque experience in a 90s office building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obey the pager to survive and climb the corporate ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.webp?t=1782412818\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.poster.avif?t=1782412818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-bit 3D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60  weird and beautiful  floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has some horror and humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is conveyed in a very indirect way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels aren't about the destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It shouldn't give you any satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caffeine-addicted butterflies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.webp?t=1782412818\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.poster.avif?t=1782412818\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str